{
  "id": 2441,
  "title": "Gold Egg",
  "russian_title": "Золото́е яйцо́",
  "level": "Intermediate",
  "torfl_level": "A2",
  "hsk_tags": [
    "A2"
  ],
  "slug": "gold-egg",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/2441_gold-egg.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "One morning, a farmer discovered that his hen had laid a golden egg. Delighted, he took the egg home. From then on, he found a golden egg every morning, and he grew richer and richer. But the farmer also grew greedier and greedier. He thought one golden egg a day was too slow, so he killed the hen to get all the golden eggs he imagined were inside her. But there was nothing inside, and he became poor again."
  ],
  "english_full": "One morning, a farmer discovered that his hen had laid a golden egg. Delighted, he took the egg home. From then on, he found a golden egg every morning, and he grew richer and richer. But the farmer also grew greedier and greedier. He thought one golden egg a day was too slow, so he killed the hen to get all the golden eggs he imagined were inside her. But there was nothing inside, and he became poor again.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "О́дним у́тром дехка́нин откры́л, что его́ ку́рица снесла́ золото́е яйцо́. Восто́рженный, он у́нёс яйцо́ домо́й. С того́ вре́мени он нахо́дил золото́е яйцо́ ка́ждое у́тро, и он станови́лся всё бога́тее и бога́тее. Но дехка́нин то́же ста́л всё жаднее и жаднее. Он ду́мал, что одно́ золото́е яйцо́ в день — это сли́шком ме́дленно, поэтому он убил ку́рицу, чтобы доста́ть все золото́е яйца́, которые, как он представля́л, были вну́три неё. Но внутри́ не было ничего́, и он опять ста́л жа́лким."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Ódnim útrom dekhkánin otkrýl, chto yégó kúritsa sneslá zolotóe yaytso. Vostórzhenniy, on únyos yaytso domóy. S tógo vremeńi on nakhodil zolotóe yaytso kázhdoe útro, i on stanov́ilsya vsyo bogátee i bogátee. No dekhkánin tózhe stal vsyo zhadnee i zhadnee. On dúmal, chto odnó zolotóe yaytso v deń — eto sliškom médlenno, poetomu on ubil kúritsu, chtoby dostátʹ vse zolotóye yaytsa, kotorýe, kak on predstav́yal, byli vnutrí neyo. No vnutrí ne bylo nichégo, i on ob́yat́ stal zhadkim."
  ],
